inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinablePowerset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinablePowerset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}powerset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinablePowerset}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land D=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A):\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(A,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}powerset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinablePowerset}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land D=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A):\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(A,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>可定义子集必须相对于语言与结构解释；裸集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不能直接出现在满足关系左侧充当结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-definable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h